Wing C — a found-footage short in the "Liminal Found Footage · Baked Light" style

Everything in the picture is generated by code in this folder: the school wing, its light (baked with three.js r187
unwrapUVs + LightMapper), the textures and notices, the camcorder look, the on-screen display and the captions.
All sound is synthesised by mix.py. No third-party footage, images, recordings or samples are used.

